{"title":"60% off | WEST SIDE STORY @ Meridian Arts Centre | $40 all in","startsAt":"2026-10-07T18:45:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-07T21:45:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Join us for **West Side Story**, one of the most beloved and powerful musicals of all time, presented in thrilling concert staging with a **cast of 12 actors and** **full 27-piece orchestra, all professional**!\n\n***Our group will save nearly 60% off the regular price! We'll be seated in Dress Circle @ $40 all fees included (regular $93.70 all in).***\n\n***CLICK ON \"Read More\" BELOW FOR FULL DETAILS.***\n\n**The Show:** Leonard Bernstein’s magnificent score and Stephen Sondheim’s unforgettable lyrics bring the story of Tony and Maria to life — two young lovers caught between rival gangs on the streets of New York City. Filled with passion, drama and iconic songs, this timeless reimagining of *Romeo and Juliet* is a rare opportunity to experience *West Side Story* with its extraordinary music taking centre stage. [More information](https://hgjewishtheatre.com/2026-2027-West-Side-Story.html).\n\n**The Cast:** The professional cast brings impressive credits from some of Canada’s leading stages, including the Stratford Festival, Shaw Festival, Mirvish, Drayton Entertainment and Neptune Theatre. Cast highlights include Emily Lukasik, a Dora Award-winning performer, Alex Wierzbicki, whose credits include Stratford and *Come From Away*, and Gryphyn Karimloo, whose credits include Shaw and *Come From Away*.\n\n***\n\n**OUR DISCOUNT TICKETS**\n\n**Group Tickets:**\n\n* **$40 including HST and service fee** (regular $93.70 with HST and service fee)\n\n***No Meetup Fee***\n\n***\n\n**HOW TO PAY**\n\n1\\. Sign up on this event page\n2\\. Send an email to **belindameetup@gmail.com** to request the payment instructions\n3\\. Specify you are inquiring about **WEST SIDE STORY**\n4\\. Include the name you use on this Thumbs Up Theatre website\n5\\. Belinda will email you the payment instructions\n6\\. IMPORTANT: If you don't receive the instructions in your inbox\\, check your junk box in case it has gone there\n\n**PAYMENT DEADLINE:** Tuesday, Oct. 6 @ 9 p.m.\nMembers must purchase their ticket(s) in advance from Belinda. Purchase early to avoid disappointment.\n\nPick up your ticket(s) from Belinda at the meetup spot on the day of performance.\n\n\\*\\*\\*\n**OVERVIEW**\n\n**When:** Wednesday, October 7, 2026\n\n**Time:** Show starts at 7:30 p.m. Meet Belinda between 6:45 p.m. and 7 p.m.\n\n**Where:** Lyric Theatre, Meridian Arts Centre, 5040 Yonge Street, North York, ON\n\n**Show Length:** 2 hours, 15 minutes with one intermission\n\n***\n\n**ACCESSIBILITY**\n\nDress Circle is not accessible for wheelchairs or walkers. If you require accessible seating in the Orchestra, please let Belinda know so she can check on availability.\n\n***\n\n**MEETUP ARRANGEMENTS**\n\nMeet Belinda any time between 6:45 p.m. and 7 p.m. inside the first set of doors at the main entrance to the theatre. Belinda will be standing on the left side as you enter. She is very short and will be wearing a bright pink hat and bright pink glasses. Cell # (416) 879-7575 (text/call) for use on the day / time of performance ONLY.\n\n**Intermission Meetup Spot:** TBA\n\n**PLEASE NOTE OUR ZERO-TOLERANCE [CELLPHONE POLICY](https://www.meetup.com/thumbs-up-theatre-toronto/events/243426512/)**","venue":{"name":"Meridian Arts Centre","address":"5040 Yonge St, North York, ON M2N 6R8, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.76648,"lng":-79.414119,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":{"amount":40,"currency":"CAD"},"group":"THUMBS UP THEATRE TORONTO - Celebrating 16 Years!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/b/0/d/b/highres_536385275.jpeg"}